T_t(A_t).
]

Substituting the usable resource function:
[
S_t(A_t|\Omega_t)
=================

\int_{\Omega_t\setminus A_t}
V_A(x,t)\alpha_A(x,t)P_A(x,t)\eta_A(x,t)k_A(x,t)G_A(x,t),dx
-----------------------------------------------------------

## M_t(A_t)

## Wc_t(A_t)

## D_t(A_t)

## Tox_t(A_t)

