A_{t+1}
=======

A_t
+
f\left[
\int_{\Omega_t\setminus A_t}
V_A(x,t)\alpha_A(x,t)P_A(x,t)\eta_A(x,t)k_A(x,t)G_A(x,t),dx
-----------------------------------------------------------

## M_t(A_t)

## Wc_t(A_t)

## D_t(A_t)

## Tox_t(A_t)

T_t(A_t)
\right]
}
]

Subject to:
[
\boxed{
A_t\in\Omega_t
\wedge
